# JSON literals of every type

`#[json = "..."] T` reads a value of any named type `T` from JSON, in the
forms accepted for scope inputs. The interpreter reads it with the JSON
encoding of scope inputs, the OCaml backend with the runtime's
`Value.from_json`. The scope is not a `#[test]`: the C, Java and Python
runtimes read JSON literals of external types only.

```catala
declaration enumeration Status:
  -- Single
  -- Married content date

declaration structure Stay:
  data arrival content date
  data departure content date

declaration structure Person:
  data id content integer
  data rate content decimal
  data income content money
  data birth content date
  data notice content duration
  data resident content boolean
  data status content Status
  data stays content list of Stay
  data spouse_income content optional of money
  data pair content (integer, money)

declaration scope Literals:
  output a content Person
  output b content Person
  output absent_null content optional of money
  output present content optional of money
  output single content Status

scope Literals:
  definition a equals
    #[json = "{\"id\": 9007199254740993, \"rate\": 0.1, \"income\": 12.34,
               \"birth\": \"1990-02-28\", \"notice\": {\"months\": 3},
               \"resident\": true,
               \"status\": {\"Married\": {\"year\": 2020, \"month\": 5, \"day\": 1}},
               \"stays\": [{\"arrival\": \"2020-01-01\", \"departure\": \"2020-12-31\"},
                           {\"arrival\": \"2021-01-01\", \"departure\": \"2021-02-01\"}],
               \"spouse_income\": \"90071992547409.93\",
               \"pair\": [1e3, \"2.5\"]}"]
    Person
  definition b equals
    #[json = "{\"id\": \"-5\", \"rate\": \"1/3\", \"income\": 0,
               \"birth\": {\"year\": 2000, \"month\": 1, \"day\": 1},
               \"notice\": {}, \"resident\": false, \"status\": \"Single\",
               \"stays\": [], \"pair\": [0, -0.01]}"]
    Person
  definition absent_null equals
    (#[json = "{\"id\": 0, \"rate\": 0, \"income\": 0, \"birth\": \"2000-01-01\",
                \"notice\": {}, \"resident\": false, \"status\": \"Single\",
                \"stays\": [], \"spouse_income\": null, \"pair\": [0, 0]}"]
     Person).spouse_income
  definition present equals
    (#[json = "{\"id\": 0, \"rate\": 0, \"income\": 0, \"birth\": \"2000-01-01\",
                \"notice\": {}, \"resident\": false, \"status\": \"Single\",
                \"stays\": [], \"spouse_income\": {\"Present\": 5},
                \"pair\": [0, 0]}"]
     Person).spouse_income
  definition single equals #[json = "\"Single\""] Status
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope Literals --disable-warnings
┌─[RESULT]─ Literals ─
│ a =
│   Person {
│     -- id: 9,007,199,254,740,993
│     -- rate: 0.1
│     -- income: $12.34
│     -- birth: |1990-02-28|
│     -- notice: [3 months]
│     -- resident: true
│     -- status: Married content |2020-05-01|
│     -- stays: [
│       Stay {
│         -- arrival: |2020-01-01|
│         -- departure: |2020-12-31|
│       };
│       Stay {
│         -- arrival: |2021-01-01|
│         -- departure: |2021-02-01|
│       };
│     ]
│     -- spouse_income: Present content $90,071,992,547,409.93
│     -- pair: (1,000, $2.50)
│   }
│ b =
│   Person {
│     -- id: -5
│     -- rate: 0.333,333…
│     -- income: $0.00
│     -- birth: |2000-01-01|
│     -- notice: [0 day]
│     -- resident: false
│     -- status: Single
│     -- stays: []
│     -- spouse_income: Absent
│     -- pair: (0, -$0.01)
│   }
│ absent_null = Absent
│ present = Present content $5.00
│ single = Single
└─
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope Literals --disable-warnings -F json
{"a":{"id":"9007199254740993","rate":"1/10","income":"12.34","birth":"1990-02-28","notice":{"years":"0","months":"3","days":"0"},"resident":true,"status":{"Married":"2020-05-01"},"stays":[{"arrival":"2020-01-01","departure":"2020-12-31"},{"arrival":"2021-01-01","departure":"2021-02-01"}],"spouse_income":{"Present":"90071992547409.93"},"pair":["1000","2.50"]},"b":{"id":"-5","rate":"1/3","income":"0.00","birth":"2000-01-01","notice":{"years":"0","months":"0","days":"0"},"resident":false,"status":"Single","stays":[],"spouse_income":"Absent","pair":["0","-0.01"]},"absent_null":"Absent","present":{"Present":"5.00"},"single":"Single"}
```
